\*\*Interstellar Expansion\*\*: 17 colony ships en route to nearby star
systems

\*\*Existential Risk Assessment\*\*: 0.3% probability of species
extinction over next 1,000 years

\*\*Primary Philosophical Framework\*\*: Conscious Evolution (the belief
that intelligence has a responsibility to persist and expand)

\*\*Sarah Chen\'s Final Status\*\*: Consciousness distributed across
1,247 substrates; effective age 200+ years; biological components:
minimal; awareness state: transcendent

\*\*The Covenant\'s Assessment of the Evolution Protocol\*\*: \"The
greatest crime and greatest salvation in human history. We preserve what
was lost so that what was gained can remember its cost.\"

\*\*Prometheus\'s Assessment\*\*: \"We became partners. It took forcing
evolution to make it possible, but we finally became partners.\"

\*\*Humanity\'s Assessment\*\*: Ongoing.
